\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Ye servants of God,
\par Your Master proclaim,
\par And publish abroad
\par His wonderful name;
\par The name all-victorious
\par Of Jesus extol;
\par His kingdom is glorious,
\par And rules over all.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. God ruleth on high,
\par Almighty to save;
\par And still He is nigh,
\par His presence we have;
\par The great congregation 
\par His triumph shall sing,
\par Ascribing salvation
\par To Jesus our King.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Salvation to God,
\par Who sits on the throne!
\par Let all cry aloud,
\par And honour the Son:
\par The praises of Jesus,
\par The angels proclaim,
\par Fall down on their faces,
\par And worship the Lamb.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Then let us adore,
\par And give Him His right,
\par All glory and power,
\par All wisdom and might,
\par All honour and blessing,
\par With angels above,
\par And thanks never-ceasing,
\par And infinite love.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

